From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: openEuler RISC-V Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tests: register Catch2 suite without helper module

The target catch2-devel package provides Catch2Config.cmake and the imported
Catch2 targets, but it does not install the optional Catch.cmake discovery
helper.  Register the same unit_tests executable directly with CTest so one
test invocation still executes every Catch2 test case.

Patch-Source: openEuler RISC-V package CI run 33712259106 and its
 SHA-256-verified immutable repository file-list metadata.
Patch-License: BSD-3-Clause
Upstream-Status: Not Submitted (automated upstream writes forbidden)
Remove-When: The target catch2-devel package provides Catch.cmake or upstream
 no longer requires that optional helper to register its complete suite.
---
 tests/unit/CMakeLists.txt | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tests/unit/CMakeLists.txt b/tests/unit/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/tests/unit/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/tests/unit/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -94,7 +94,5 @@
 )
-
+
 include(CTest)
-include(Catch)
-
+
-catch_discover_tests(unit_tests)
-
+add_test(NAME unit_tests COMMAND unit_tests)
